    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for STONITH (power-cycle / evict) backends. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Concrete implementations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold><ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_null_stonith_provider" kindref="compound">NullStonithProvider</ref></bold> — no-op; used in tests and single-node setups.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>IpmiStonithProvider</bold> — sends <computeroutput>ipmitool chassis power off</computeroutput> to the BMC.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>MtlsRevocationProvider</bold> — revokes the node&apos;s mTLS certificate so it can no longer issue authenticated RPCs. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
